  (36178, 0, 0, 'Heading to the Wild Overlook.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36403, 0, 0, 'Nobody panic! I''ll see to it we get off of this deplorable island. You''ll see... I''ve got it all planned out!', 14, 0, 100, 274, 0, 19588, 0, 0, '36379'),
  (36403, 0, 1, 'Never fear, Trade Prince Gallywix is here. We''ll be on our way to our new home in Azshara before you know it! Despite the bumbling interference of $N', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 19589, 0, 0, '36380'),
  (36403, 0, 2, 'I can''t help but think that if it weren''t for the meddling of $N back on Kezan, we''d all be safe and sound in Azshara by now.', 14, 0, 100, 5, 0, 19590, 0, 0, '36381'),
  (36403, 0, 3, 'I''ve got my eye on you, $N. Let''s just say that only one of us will be leaving this island, and that goblin''s name begins with Trade Prince!', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 19591, 0, 0, '36382'),
  (36403, 0, 4, 'You thought to take my place on Kezan, $N? You reach too far! I made you what you were... were being the operative word. You''re nothing now. Nothing!', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 19592, 0, 0, '36383'),
  (36403, 0, 5, 'I want you all to listen good... anyone who''s not with me can start looking for a new job!', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 19593, 0, 0, '36384'),
  (36403, 0, 6, 'No worries, everyone. This is just a short pit stop on our way to our new home.', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 19594, 0, 0, '36385'),
  (36425, 0, 0, 'Uh oh, it''s the Trade Prince.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36470, 0, 0, 'Hurry, $n, deploy the Town-In-A-Box. Our people are trapped inside! Oh! I almost forgot your parachute.', 12, 0, 100, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36471, 0, 0, 'Hobart''s right behind you, $g sir : ma''am;.', 12, 0, 100, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36471, 1, 0, 'Remember, look for the pygmy leaders: Gaahl, Malmo, and Teloch.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36513, 0, 0, 'You think you''re such a bigshot, saving everyone and making friends with these orc savages?!', 14, 0, 100, 25, 0, 19584, 0, 0, 'Prince marchand Gallywix'),
  (36513, 1, 0, 'I''m gonna crush you. I''m the Trade Prince, me! I''ve got a plan that''s gonna get me off this island and make me the King of Azshara!', 14, 0, 100, 25, 0, 19585, 0, 0, 'Prince marchand Gallywix'),
  (36513, 2, 0, 'Mark my words! I''m gonna get you, $N! I''ll get you all! Out of my way!', 14, 0, 100, 15, 0, 19586, 0, 0, 'Prince marchand Gallywix'),
  (36519, 0, 0, 'I knew I should have brought my folding chair.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36519, 0, 1, 'That rocket looks unsafe even by our standards!', 12, 0, 100, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
