  (48305, 1, 0, 'It''s the fault of this madman from Hobart Martelutte! Someone has to shoot this guy and promote his assistant!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (48494, 0, 0, 'Prepare the Micro Mechachicken!', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 1, 0, 'There''s a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 2, 0, 'Excellent. Now back away from the Ultra Concave Fissionable Testing Platform. Slowly, if you please.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 3, 0, 'Thank you. Now behold as I stabilize the highly unstable miniaturization process.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 4, 0, 'I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 5, 0, 'I''ll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all times! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 6, 0, 'Flip the switch!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 7, 0, 'Quite right, Greely. You passed today''s pop quiz.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 8, 0, 'I am now flipping the switch!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
  (48494, 9, 0, 'Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'say Text'),
